<h1>Nova Express</h1>

<i>Nova Express</i> is a quarterly fanzine published out of Austin Texas.
It specializes in interviews, reviews, and bibliographies. A four issue
subscription is $12.00; write to:
<pre>
    Nova Express
    P.O. Box 27231
    Austin, TX 78755-2231
</pre>
They also have a
<a href="http://www.delphi.com/sflit/novaexpress/">web page</a> up and
running.
<p>
The 1987-1992 Nova Express data was provided by Glen Engel-Cox.

